@Demo.JwtAuth.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5117

### 健康检查
GET {{Demo.JwtAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 登录（演示：任意非空用户名密码均可；返回 accessToken + refreshToken）
POST {{Demo.JwtAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "x"
}

### 刷新（把 <refreshToken> 替换为登录返回的 refreshToken；旧值一次性轮换，重放返回 401）
POST {{Demo.JwtAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"
}

### 当前用户（把 <accessToken> 替换为登录返回的 accessToken）
GET {{Demo.JwtAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
